{
 "about": "The self-tests `tools/selftest.sh` runs (`tools/gate.py selftest`), in its order: a step builds (`build`: swiftc's arguments, through tools/gate/swiftc) and runs (`run`: a bash line, in app/SpektraLab, with $here $src $out). `group`: run alone with its group (one binary built at one path). `weight`: seconds it runs, longest first. `reads`: what it reads besides its command line; `reads_only`: it compiles nothing, so `reads` and the line are all. Made from selftest.sh on 2026-11-14; a new self-test is a new step here. `component`: the step's own component, where its compile list alone would guess another (`gate.py self-test`).",
